We need an Image that agrees with us on layout and Filesystem. So no matter where you get your original img file from,
neutralize it as follows:

*dd if=/dev/zero of=this.img bs=1024M count=4   // Decide on memory size and tweak count

mkfs.ext4 -F this.img   // Overlay it with EXT4

mkdir dst
*sudo mount -o loop this.img mnt/

*sudo cp -a SRC_of_img/* mnt/.

sync

*sudo umount mnt

//////
Thats it, you re good to go now!
